l efficiency and its potential to generate earnings. It can influence investment decisions and evaluations of the banking sector's attractiveness.^Changes in the ratio reflect the impact of monetary policy, especially policies on interest rates and reserve requirements, which influence this ratio. Higher demand for loans may lead to increased interest rates."},{"question":"How to interpret the SCBs Credit Deposit Ratio data ?","answer":"$2d"}],"related":[{"slug":"aggregate-bank-deposits","title":"Aggregate Bank Deposits"},{"slug":"bank-credit-industry","title":"Bank Credit - Industry"},{"slug":"bank-credit-personal-loans","title":"Bank Credit - Personal Loans"},{"slug":"bank-credit-services","title":"Bank Credit - Services"},{"slug":"cash-reserve-ratio-crr","title":"Cash Reserve Ratio (CRR)"},{"slug":"foreign-exchange-reserves","title":"Foreign Exchange Reserves"},{"slug":"foreign-portfolio-investments-fpis-debt","title":"Foreign Portfolio Investments (FPIs) - Debt"},{"slug":"marginal-cost-of-funds-based-lending-rates-mclr","title":"Marginal Cost of Funds based Lending Rates (MCLR)"},{"slug":"money-supply-m3","title":"Money Supply (M3)"},{"slug":"nifty-bank-pe-ratio","title":"NIFTY Bank P/E Ratio"},{"slug":"rbi-liquidity-net-laf","title":"RBI Liquidity (Net LAF)"},{"slug":"repo-rate","title":"Repo Rate"},{"slug":"statutory-liquidity-ratio-slr","title":"Statutory Liquidity Ratio (SLR)"},{"slug":"term-deposit-rate","title":"Term Deposit Rate"},{"slug":"weighted-average-lending-rate-on-fresh-rupee-loans-walr","title":"Weighted Average Lending Rate on Fresh Rupee Loans (WALR)"}],"title":"Credit-Deposit Ratio","description":"India's credit-deposit ratio stands at 81% for Sep 2026. This ratio shows the share of deposits banks have lent out and is a key gauge of liquidity conditions.","headline":{"Absolute":"India's credit-deposit ratio stands at 81% for Sep 2026. This ratio shows the share of deposits banks have lent out and is a key gauge of liquidity conditions."},"sour